  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This COB LED Strip Light Combo Kit offers a seamless DIY lighting experience. The set includes high-quality White CCT Tunable COB LED Strip Light, Solderless Quick Connector, and a 24V Power Adapter. Simply connect the components to control and switch between various lighting modes. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced maker, you can use this all-in-one kit to ccreate lighting projects effortlessly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Tunable White COB LED Strip Light"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This LED light strip offers adjustable white light with a color temperature range from warm white to cool white (2700K-6500K). You can automatically select the appropriate mode based on your own model design. It fulfills your various needs, providing you with more possibilities for your creations."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Illuminate Your Printing Journey"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Experience enhanced visibility of the printing process with the internal illumination provided by this LED light strip. Watch as your models come to life layer by layer, with improved clarity and precision. Perfect for detailed observation and capturing stunning visuals, this lighting solution takes your printing experience to the next level."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Consideration"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Power Safety 1. Always disconnect the power supply before starting any installation to prevent electric shock or short circuits."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. Ensure you are using the correct voltage as specified on the product to avoid damage, overheating, or potential fire hazards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. Total connected length must not exceed 3 meters with the included adapter, as doing so triggers overload protection and will result in an abnormal power supply."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Cutting & Bending 1. Cut only along the predefined cut marks to maintain electrical continuity and proper function. Cutting in the wrong place may lead to circuit failure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. Avoid bending or twisting the lamp strip over very short distances, as this can damage internal wiring and compromise durability."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. If bending is required, do so gradually and within the recommended bending radius to prevent breakage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Soldering & Heat Protection 1. Use a soldering iron with appropriate temperature control when attaching wiring heads to avoid overheating components."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. Keep the luminescent colloid (LEDs and surrounding encapsulation) away from excessive heat, as high temperatures can cause burns, discoloration, or reduced lifespan."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Operational Integrity 1. Follow the manufacturer’s guidelines for installation and usage to ensure the strip functions correctly and lasts as intended."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. Improper handling, excessive bending, or exposure to incompatible environmental conditions may compromise the product’s performance and safety."
    }
  ],
